:: Forest - kidnapper rescue won [bg-forest]
<h1 class="ptitle">FOREST</h1>
<br />

<<set _kidnapped = $guests[$forestKidnapEvent]>>


<center>
    <<image 'places/forest/forest_kidnapper_won.jpg' sfw>>
</center>
<br />

They're down. You moved to the post and cut her loose. She didn't say anything for a long time — just stood there, breathing. Her hands were shaking but her jaw was set.

Then she nodded and followed you back without a word.
<br /><br />

<<set _kidnapped.relationship = Math.max((_kidnapped.relationship ?? 0) + 15, -100)>>
<<set _kidnapped.happy = Math.max((_kidnapped.happy ?? 0) - 15, -100)>>
<<set _kidnapped.sick = {days: randomInteger(2, 5), desc: 'Shaken and bruised', id: 'exhaustion'}>>
<<set $forestKidnapEvent = null>>

<strong>(<<=setup.displayName(_kidnapped)>>: Relationship +15, Happy −15, sick <<=_kidnapped.sick.days>> days)</strong>
<br /><br />

<<link 'Take her home'>>
    <<goto 'Wood cabin'>>
<</link>>
